<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken to hold Stadshypotek mtg.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken to hold Stadshypotek mtg.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Svenska Handelsbanken said it was holding a press conference in Stockholm at 1500 GMT on Thursday concerning mortgage bank Stadshypotek.  </p>
<p>The government announced late last month that it wanted to see its 34 percent stake in Stadshypotek sold by controlled auction to the highest bidder.</p>
<p>Skandia and Stadshypotek also announced a proposed merger which was criticisd by the government.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
